OL,3,GNEWSAHistorical toll bridge reopens
OL,4,Aafter tanker crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA toll bridge dating back to the 18th
OL,7,FCentury that links two parts of a Kent
OL,8,Ftown has reopened, two months after it
OL,9,Fwas struck by a tanker.
OL,11,FThe bridge in Sandwich was damaged
OL,12,Fwhile Southern Water tankers were
OL,13,Frepairing three burst sewer mains
OL,14,Fbetween Deal and Ramsgate.
OL,16,FOne of the vehicles hit the structure,
OL,17,Fforcing its closure on 8 August, with
OL,18,Femergency restoration starting last
OL,19,Fmonth.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
